        "title": "Ekushey Project Manager CRM 5.0 Stored XSS via Ticket Title Field",
        "descriptions": [
          {
            "lang": "en",
            "value": "Ekushey Project Manager CRM through version 5.0 ccontains a stored cross-site scripting vulnerability that allows authenticated client users to inject arbitrary HTML and JavaScript by entering malicious payloads into the Ticket Title field on the Create New Ticket page. Attackers can craft and store malicious scripts that execute in the browser sessions of Staff or Administrator users who view the Client Support page where ticket titles are rendered unsanitized."
          }
        ],
        "datePublic": "2026-07-25T00:00:00.000Z",
        "problemTypes": [
          {
